  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#html-element-constructors\r\n\r\n> Since there can be no entry in registry with a constructor of undefined, this step also prevents...\r\n\r\n[Custom Element definition][Element definition] must throw when `constructor` is undefined, so there should be actually no entry in registry with a constructor of undefined.\r\n\r\n[Element definition]: https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-customelementregistry-define",
